# NAME: Hong Kong Bank (Loon)
# AUTHOR: z285chen
# REPO: https://github.com/z285chen/Quantumult-X-Rules
# REVIEWED: 2026-09-18 | CONVERTED: 2026-11-14
# FORMAT: Loon remote rule; this file carries no policy name.
# POLICY: map it in [Remote Rule] with policy=Bank (or your own policy).
# ACTIVE RULES: 12
# Scope: HSBC HK / EleBank / ZA / Wise; not all Hong Kong banks.
# Source: HongKongBank.list (Quantumult X). Mapping and caveats: docs/Loon.md
# Create/select the policy before import. No claim of complete App coverage.

# HSBC HK and shared HSBC services
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,hsbc.com.hk
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,hsbc.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,hsbc
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,hsbc.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,hsbcnet.com
# PayMe / vv1865: community-maintained HSBC domain inventory
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,vv1865.com

# EleBank
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,elebank.com

# ZA: inherited from upstream Bank.list; App coverage unverified
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,za.group
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,zainvest.group
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,zajourney.com

# Wise: included for personal use alongside HK banks
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,wise.com
# Official Wise documentation also lists this production API endpoint
DOMAIN,api.transferwise.com

# Optional HSBC-specific third-party hosts from upstream; enable after testing
# DOMAIN,c-hsbc.lytics.io
# DOMAIN,hsbc.edge.sdk.awswaf.com
# DOMAIN,log-58144bf0.we-stats.com

# Optional SHARED third-party services from upstream (disabled by default).
# Enabling these also routes other apps using the same hosts through Bank.
# HSBC-related observations:
# DOMAIN,mobile.eum-appdynamics.com
# DOMAIN,tags.tiqcdn.com
# DOMAIN,cdn.optimizely.com
# DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tealiumiq.com
# DOMAIN-SUFFIX,online-metrix.net
# DOMAIN-SUFFIX,liveperson.net
# DOMAIN-SUFFIX,lpsnmedia.net
# EleBank-related observation:
# DOMAIN-SUFFIX,appsflyersdk.com
# ZA-related observations:
# DOMAIN-SUFFIX,crashlytics.com
# DOMAIN,app-measurement.com
# Wise-related observation:
# DOMAIN,api.mixpanel.com
